  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "theoreticalsciences:anomaly_resolution_engine",
      "title": "Anomaly Resolution Engine",
      "text": "A tower of reality-lattice casing around a column of lensed, error-corrected fields. It doses an anomaly fraction by fraction until not one of its cells is left, and writes what it learned back into the laws.$(br2)$(thing)Tier 5$() machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "This controller is too complex for a crafting grid. Build it on the $(item)Femtoscale Assembly Line$() - check JEI for the exact parts."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Cures: resistant clones become ordinary stem cells again and leave $(fluid)Renormalised Essence$(). Then resolves: a catalogued, quarantined anomaly - or a Local Law Violation, renormalised - becomes a $(item)Resolved Anomaly$()."
    },
